== Notes ==
* Only the listed peculiarities are predetermined. Everything else is randomly generated by the game.
* If a curated daily with a set goal lands on a Monday, it will be on Normal mode instead.
** {{dlc|r+}} Set goal will also take priority over Mother.
* If a curated daily with a set goal lands on a Sunday, the set goal will take priority over Mega Satan. This may not always hold true across different DLC run versions, however.
* Starting Items can be removed with {{i|D4}} effects, {{i|Clicker}} or {{p|0 - The Fool?}} with {{i|Tarot Cloth|n}}.
* {{p|Soul of the Forgotten}} or {{p|Soul of Jacob and Esau|n}} will copy all starting items (including Active Items), grant the same amount of starting pickups and drop a copy of the starting Trinket/Card/Pill/Rune.
* {{dlc|r}}Curated item pools work slightly differently: Encountering one of the Items in a Treasure Room will not [[Item Pool#Weight Decrementation|decrement its weight]], allowing it to reappear again. Picking them up or encountering them in a different item pool will decrement them as usual. Once all of the listed Items have been removed, the item pool will turn back to normal.

